    "faq": {
      "type": "vb-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is included in the Pregnancy Support Pack and how much do I save?",
            "answer": "<p>The pack contains 1x PregBiotics Essentials + Omega 60s (R509.95) and 2x Velo16 Probiotics Calcium & Magnesium 60s (R299.95 each), providing a total component value of R1,109.85. At the pack price of R942.60, you save R167.25.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I take the components in this pack?",
            "answer": "<p>Take 1 to 2 softgels of PregBiotics Essentials + Omega daily with water after breakfast or lunch. Take 2 capsules of Velo16 Probiotics Calcium & Magnesium daily with water, preferably in the evening or with meals. Always discuss with your doctor or midwife before use.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I take this pack across all trimesters of pregnancy?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, the ingredients are formulated for general support throughout pregnancy and preconception. Because individual maternal health needs vary, always discuss with your doctor or midwife at your routine prenatal appointments before starting or changing any supplement regimen.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does this pack prevent birth defects or treat pregnancy conditions?",
            "answer": "<p>No. Dietary supplements provide nutritional support for general maternal health, fetal brain development, and bone wellness. They do not prevent, cure, or treat any medical condition or birth defect. Always consult your healthcare professional for medical advice.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does micro-shielding work in these probiotics?",
            "answer": "<p>Our patented process applies a protective micro-shield around each bacterium (never the capsule shell alone). This shielding protects live cultures through gastric stomach acid so over 90% arrive safely in the gut to support nutrient absorption. Learn more about <a href=\"/pages/what-is-microencapsulation\">how Velobiotics micro-shielding works</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q6": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How should I store the products in this pack?",
            "answer": "<p>Store all bottles in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight below 25\u00b0C. Thanks to micro-shielding around each bacterium, the probiotic strains are shelf-stable and do not require refrigeration.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q7": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is your refund policy?",
            "answer": "<p>We offer a 30-day money-back guarantee. If you are not completely satisfied, contact our customer care team at support@velobiotics.com.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
